{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31035","headline":"除夜作 · 薛能","name":"除夜作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"和吹度穹旻，虚徐接建寅。\n不辞加一岁，唯喜到三春。\n燎照云烟好，幡悬井邑新。\n祯祥应北极，调燮验平津。\n树欲含迟日，山将退旧尘。\n兰萎残此夜，竹爆和诸邻。\n祝寿思明圣，驱傩看鬼神。\n团圆多少辈，眠寝独劳筋。\n茜斾犹双节，雕盘又五辛。\n何当平贼後，归作自由身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31035.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31035","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}